msgstr "Meldungswarteschlange, Verwarnungen, Sperren, Einsprüche"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:336
msgid "REST API, Gutenberg blocks, 1 outbound webhook"
msgstr "REST API, Gutenberg-Blöcke, 1 ausgehender Webhook"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:337
msgid "Scheduled & recurring posts, up to 10 pinned posts"
msgstr "Geplante und wiederkehrende Beiträge, bis zu 10 angeheftete Beiträge"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:338
msgid "Custom reaction emoji set (up to 20)"
msgstr "Benutzerdefinierte Reaktions-Emoji-Set (bis zu 20)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:339
msgid "Broadcast email campaigns + drip welcome sequences"
msgstr "Broadcast-E-Mail-Kampagnen + Tropfen-Willkommenssequenzen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:340
msgid "Group DM + real-time delivery, typing, read receipts"
msgstr "Gruppen-DM + Echtzeitbereitstellung, Eingabe, Lesebestätigungen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:341
msgid "Real-time feed updates + online presence"
msgstr "Echtzeit-Feed-Updates + Online-Präsenz"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:342
msgid "Advanced moderation — keyword/link rules, AI, bulk actions"
msgstr "Erweiterte Moderation — Schlüsselwort-/Link-Regeln, AI, Massenaktionen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:343
msgid "Site + per-space analytics with CSV export"
msgstr "Website + Pro-Space-Analytik mit CSV-Export"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:344
msgid "Private/gated spaces, post approval, paywall, member tiers"
msgstr ""
"Private/gesperrte Spaces, Beitragsgenehmigung, Bezahlschranke, "
"Mitgliedsstufen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:345
msgid "Advanced profile fields + custom member labels"
msgstr "Erweiterte Profilfelder + benutzerdefinierte Mitgliedsetiketten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:346
msgid "AI feed ranking + AI content moderation"
msgstr "AI-Feed-Ranking + AI-Inhaltsmoderation"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:347
msgid "Saved searches + advanced filters"
msgstr "Gespeicherte Suchen + erweiterte Filter"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:355 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2978
msgid "Free"
msgstr "Kostenlos"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:356
msgid "Pro"
msgstr "Pro"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:373
msgid "Not included"
msgstr "Nicht enthalten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:397
msgid "Brand identity, discovery defaults, and direct messaging baseline."
msgstr "Markenidentität, Erkennungsstandards und Direktnachrichten-Grundlinie."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:398
msgid "Pick which features your community uses. Core features always run."
msgstr ""
"Wähle, welche Funktionen deine Gemeinschaft verwendet. Kernfunktionen laufen "
"immer."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:399
msgid "Control who can sign up and how new accounts are verified."
msgstr ""
"Kontrolliere, wer sich anmelden kann und wie neue Konten verifiziert werden."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:400
msgid "Follow, connect, and block — the relationships that drive the feed."
msgstr ""
"Folge, verbinde und blockiere — die Beziehungen, die den Feed antreiben."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:401
msgid "Defaults for the Spaces module: who can create, how deep they nest."
msgstr ""
"Standards für das Spaces-Modul: wer erstellen kann, wie tief sie "
"verschachtelt sind."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:402
msgid "In-app + email notification rules and the events that trigger them."
msgstr ""
"In-App + E-Mail-Benachrichtigungsregeln und die Ereignisse, die sie auslösen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:403
msgid ""
"Sender identity and delivery configuration for outgoing community email."
msgstr ""
"Absenderidentität und Lieferkonfiguration für ausgehende Community-E-Mails."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:404
msgid ""
"Site-wide moderation toggles: reporting, auto-hide thresholds, mod roles."
msgstr ""
"Website-weite Moderationsschalter: Meldung, Auto-Hide-Schwellenwerte, "
"Moderationsrollen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:405
msgid ""
"Wbcom companion plugins that light up extra features - install and activate "
"in one click."
msgstr ""
"Wbcom-Begleit-Plugins, die zusätzliche Funktionen freischalten – in einem "
"Klick installieren und aktivieren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:406
msgid "Data retention, export, and member privacy controls."
msgstr "Datenspeicherung, Export und Datenschutzkontrollen für Mitglieder."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:407
msgid "Push community events to external services in real time."
msgstr "Schiebe Community-Ereignisse in Echtzeit zu externen Services."

#. translators: %s: the administrator's own IP address.
#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:544
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your own address (%s) was removed from the blocked list. Blocking it would "
"have locked you out of your own site — the blocklist refuses sign-in, and it "
"does not make an exception for administrators."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:597
msgid "Private Community"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:603
msgid "Require login to view the community"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:604
msgid ""
"When on, every BuddyNext page — feed, members, profiles, spaces, "
"notifications, settings, search — and its REST data require login; logged-"
"out visitors are sent to the login page. Only the login / register / "
"password-reset page stays public. Use this for a fully private, members-only "
"community."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:612
msgid "Search Engine Indexing"
msgstr "Suchmaschinen-Indexierung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:618
msgid "Allow search engines to index"
msgstr "Erlaube Suchmaschinen zu indexieren"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:621
msgid "Everything — public posts, profiles, and spaces"
msgstr "Alles – öffentliche Beiträge, Profile und Spaces"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:622
msgid "Public posts only"
msgstr "Nur öffentliche Beiträge"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:623
msgid "Nothing — noindex all community pages"
msgstr "Nichts – noindex alle Community-Seiten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:625
msgid ""
"Controls the robots meta tag on BuddyNext front-end pages. Profiles and "
"spaces always respect their own privacy settings regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""
"Steuert das robots-Meta-Tag auf BuddyNext-Frontend-Seiten. Profile und "
"Spaces respektieren ihre Datenschutzeinstellungen immer, unabhängig von "
"dieser Einstellung."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:632
msgid "Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Cookie-Zustimmung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:638
msgid "Show cookie consent notice"
msgstr "Zeige Cookie-Zustimmungshinweis"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:639
msgid ""
"Display a consent banner on first visit. Required in some jurisdictions (EU/"
"GDPR). BuddyNext itself sets only functional cookies."
msgstr ""
"Zeige ein Zustimmungsbanner beim ersten Besuch. Erforderlich in einigen "
"Gerichtsbarkeiten (EU/DSGVO). BuddyNext setzt selbst nur funktionale Cookies."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:647
msgid "Notice text"
msgstr "Benachrichtigungstext"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:648
msgid ""
"Wording shown in the banner. Leave blank to use the default. No effect "
"unless the notice is turned on above."
msgstr ""
"Text, der im Banner angezeigt wird. Leer lassen, um den Standard zu "
"verwenden. Hat keine Auswirkung, es sei denn, die Benachrichtigung ist oben "
"aktiviert."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:656
msgid "Accept button label"
msgstr "Akzeptieren-Schaltflächenbeschriftung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:657
msgid "Text on the dismiss button. Leave blank for the default (\"Got it\")."
msgstr ""
"Text auf der Schaltfläche zum Verwerfen. Leer lassen für die "
"Standardeinstellung (\"Verstanden\")."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:665
msgid "Privacy-policy link label"
msgstr "Datenschutzrichtlinien-Link-Beschriftung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:666
msgid ""
"Text of the link to your privacy policy (shown only when a Privacy Policy "
"page is set in Settings → Privacy). Leave blank for the default (\"Privacy "
"policy\")."
msgstr ""
"Text des Links zu deiner Datenschutzrichtlinie (wird nur angezeigt, wenn "
"eine Datenschutzrichtlinienseite in Einstellungen → Datenschutz eingestellt "
"ist). Leer lassen für die Standardeinstellung (\"Datenschutzrichtlinie\")."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:674
msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Datenspeicherung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:680
msgid "Data retention (days)"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:693
msgid ""
"Automatically delete records older than this: activity log, closed "
"moderation reports, and (with Pro) analytics events. Open reports and the "
"moderation log are never deleted. Set to 0 to keep them indefinitely."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:700
msgid "Notification & email log retention"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:703 includes/Admin/Settings.php:722
msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 Tage"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:704
msgid "60 days"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:705 includes/Admin/Settings.php:724
msgid "90 days"
msgstr "90 Tage"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:712
msgid ""
"How long to keep read notifications and the email log. These are the fastest-"
"growing tables on a busy community, so they are kept on a shorter window "
"than the rest. Unread notifications are kept longer, so nothing a member has "
"not seen is deleted early."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:719
msgid "Notification and email log retention"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:723
msgid "60 days (recommended)"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: the hard maximum, in days, that unread notifications are kept.
#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:732
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Permanently deletes READ notifications and email-log entries older than "
"this. Unread notifications are always kept for the full %d days, whatever "
"you choose here, so nothing a member has not seen is removed early. Runs "
"once a day in the background. This cannot be undone — these tables are a "
"log, not member content."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:741
msgid "Member Rights"
msgstr "Mitgliederrechte"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:747
msgid "Allow members to export their data"
msgstr "Erlaube Mitgliedern, ihre Daten zu exportieren"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:749
msgid ""
"Adds a \"Download my data\" option on member profile settings. Generates a "
"JSON archive of posts, reactions, and profile fields."
msgstr ""
"Fügt eine \"Meine Daten herunterladen\"-Option in den Profileinstellungen "
"des Mitglieds hinzu. Generiert ein JSON-Archiv von Beiträgen, Reaktionen und "
"Profilfeldern."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:756
msgid "Allow members to delete their account"
msgstr "Erlaube Mitgliedern, ihr Konto zu löschen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:758
msgid ""
"Adds a \"Delete account\" option on member profile settings. Admins can "
"always delete accounts regardless of this setting."
msgstr ""
"Fügt eine \"Konto löschen\"-Option in den Profileinstellungen des Mitglieds "
"hinzu. Admins können Konten immer löschen, unabhängig von dieser Einstellung."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:773
msgid "Auto (fit to width)"
msgstr "Automatisch (an Breite anpassen)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:774
msgid "2 columns"
msgstr "2 Spalten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:775
msgid "3 columns"
msgstr "3 Spalten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:776
msgid "4 columns"
msgstr "4 Spalten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:781
msgid "Community Identity"
msgstr "Community-Identität"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:787
msgid "Community Name"
msgstr "Community-Name"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:788
msgid "Displayed in the site header, emails, and browser title."
msgstr "Wird in der Website-Kopfzeile, E-Mails und im Browser-Titel angezeigt."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:796
msgid "Brand color"
msgstr "Markenfarbe"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:799
msgid ""
"Your community accent — used for buttons, links, active tabs, and badges "
"across every member-facing screen. Click the swatch to pick, or paste a hex "
"code."
msgstr ""
"Deine Community-Akzentfarbe – wird für Schaltflächen, Links, aktive "
"Registerkarten und Abzeichen auf allen Mitglieder-Seiten verwendet. Klicke "
"auf das Farbmuster zum Auswählen, oder füge einen Hex-Code ein."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:806
msgid "Community Description"
msgstr "Community-Beschreibung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:807
msgid "Short description shown on the community landing page and in meta tags."
msgstr ""
"Kurzbeschreibung, die auf der Community-Landingpage und in Meta-Tags "
"angezeigt wird."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:814
msgid "Discovery"
msgstr "Entdeckung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:820
msgid "Public explore feed"
msgstr "Öffentlicher Erkunden-Feed"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:821
msgid "Allow guests to browse the explore feed without logging in."
msgstr "Erlaube Gästen, den Erkunden-Feed ohne Anmeldung zu durchsuchen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:829
msgid "Media links"
msgstr "Medien-Links"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:832
msgid "Open the activity it was posted in"
msgstr "Öffne die Aktivität, in der es gepostet wurde"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:833
msgid "Open a dedicated media page"
msgstr "Öffne eine dedizierte Medienseite"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:836
msgid ""
"Members post media as activity updates. \"Open the activity\" keeps every "
"media link inside the feed: its /media/ page redirects to the post it was "
"shared in, so media is not exposed as a separate public URL. \"Open a "
"dedicated media page\" keeps a standalone page per item, for gallery-style "
"sites."
msgstr ""
"Mitglieder posten Medien als Aktivitätsaktualisierungen. \"Öffne die "
"Aktivität\" hält jeden Medien-Link im Feed: seine /media/-Seite leitet zum "
"Post weiter, in dem es geteilt wurde, sodass Medien nicht als separate "
"öffentliche URL verfügbar sind. \"Öffne eine dedizierte Medienseite\" behält "
"eine eigenständige Seite pro Element für Galerien."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:843
msgid "Direct Messaging"
msgstr "Direktnachrichten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:849
msgid "Enable direct messaging"
msgstr "Direktnachrichten aktivieren"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:854
msgid ""
"Allow members to send private messages. Requires the WPMediaVerse plugin."
msgstr ""
"Erlaube Mitgliedern, private Nachrichten zu senden. Erfordert das "
"WPMediaVerse-Plugin."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:855
msgid ""
"Direct Messaging requires the WPMediaVerse plugin. Install and activate it "
"to enable this feature."
msgstr ""
"Direktnachrichten erfordern das WPMediaVerse-Plugin. Installiere und "
"aktiviere es, um diese Funktion zu aktivieren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:862
msgid "Who can DM me (default)"
msgstr "Wer kann mir DMs schreiben (Standard)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:865 includes/Admin/Settings.php:2567
#: templates/parts/settings-privacy-fields.php:31
#: templates/parts/settings-privacy-fields.php:41
#: templates/parts/settings-privacy-fields.php:47
#: templates/parts/settings-privacy-fields.php:51
msgid "Everyone"
msgstr "Jeder"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:868
msgid "No one"
msgstr "Niemand"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:870
msgid ""
"Default privacy applied to new accounts. Members can override this in their "
"own privacy settings."
msgstr ""
"Standarddatenschutz wird auf neue Konten angewendet. Mitglieder können dies "
"in ihren eigenen Datenschutzeinstellungen ändern."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:877
msgid "Directory columns"
msgstr "Verzeichnisspalten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:883
msgid "Member directory columns (desktop)"
msgstr "Mitglieds-Verzeichnisspalten (Desktop)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:887
msgid ""
"How many member cards per row on desktop. A fixed value caps the row and "
"still steps down to fewer columns on tablet and mobile; Auto fits as many as "
"the width allows."
msgstr ""
"Wie viele Mitgliedskarten pro Zeile auf dem Desktop angezeigt werden. Ein "
"fester Wert begrenzt die Zeile und reduziert die Spaltenzahl auf Tablets und "
"Mobilgeräten; Automatisch passt sich der verfügbaren Breite an."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:894
msgid "Space directory columns (desktop)"
msgstr "Bereich-Verzeichnisspalten (Desktop)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:898
msgid ""
"How many space cards per row on desktop in the Spaces directory. A fixed "
"value caps the row and still steps down on tablet and mobile; Auto fits as "
"many as the width allows."
msgstr ""
"Wie viele Bereichs-Karten pro Zeile auf dem Desktop im Bereiche-Verzeichnis "
"angezeigt werden. Ein fester Wert begrenzt die Zeile und reduziert die "
"Spaltenzahl auf Tablets und Mobilgeräten; Automatisch passt sich der "
"verfügbaren Breite an."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:905 templates/shell/hub-shell.php:118
msgid "Community menu"
msgstr "Community-Menü"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:911
msgid "Auto-place the community menu in your theme"
msgstr "Platziere das Community-Menü automatisch in deinem Theme"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:913
msgid ""
"Drops the Feed / Members / Spaces menu into your theme automatically. Turn "
"off to use your theme's own menu instead. To rename, reorder, or hide "
"individual items, use the Navigation tab."
msgstr ""
"Platziert automatisch das Feed / Mitglieder / Bereiche-Menü in deinem Theme. "
"Deaktiviere dies, um stattdessen das Menü deines Themes zu verwenden. Um "
"einzelne Elemente umzubenennen, neu zu ordnen oder auszublenden, nutze den "
"Navigation-Reiter."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:920
msgid "Show the desktop sidebar rail"
msgstr "Zeige die Desktop-Seitenleiste an"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:922
msgid ""
"The left navigation rail on desktop hub pages. Turn off to hide the desktop "
"rail while keeping the mobile bottom bar. Only applies when community "
"navigation (above) is on."
msgstr ""
"Die linke Navigationsleiste auf Desktop-Hub-Seiten. Deaktiviere dies, um die "
"Desktop-Leiste auszublenden und die Mobile-Bottom-Bar zu behalten. Gilt nur, "
"wenn die Community-Navigation (oben) aktiviert ist."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:929
msgid "Show the mobile bottom tab bar"
msgstr "Zeige die Mobile-Bottom-Tab-Leiste an"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:931
msgid ""
"The bottom navigation bar on mobile hub pages. Turn off to hide the mobile "
"bar while keeping the desktop rail. Only applies when community navigation "
"(above) is on."
msgstr ""
"Die untere Navigationsleiste auf Mobile-Hub-Seiten. Deaktiviere dies, um die "
"Mobile-Leiste auszublenden und die Desktop-Leiste zu behalten. Gilt nur, "
"wenn die Community-Navigation (oben) aktiviert ist."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:948 includes/Core/PageRouter.php:643
#: assets/js/blocks.js:119
msgid "Activity Feed"
msgstr "Aktivitätsfeed"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:954
msgid "Default post visibility"
msgstr "Standardsichtbarkeit von Beiträgen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:962
msgid "Members can override this in their own post composer."
msgstr "Mitglieder können dies in ihrem Beitragskomponist überschreiben."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:969
msgid "Allow polls"
msgstr "Umfragen erlauben"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:972
msgid "Members can attach a poll to their posts."
msgstr "Mitglieder können ihren Beiträgen eine Umfrage beifügen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:979
msgid "Allow re-shares"
msgstr "Neu-Teilen erlauben"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:982
msgid "Members can share other members' posts to their own feed."
msgstr ""
"Mitglieder können Beiträge anderer Mitglieder in ihrem eigenen Feed teilen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:989
msgid "Allow bookmarks"
msgstr "Lesezeichen erlauben"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:992
msgid "Members can save posts to a private bookmarks list."
msgstr ""
"Mitglieder können Beiträge in einer privaten Lesezeichenliste speichern."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:999
msgid "Enable link previews"
msgstr "Link-Vorschauen aktivieren"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1001
msgid ""
"When a post contains a URL, fetch and display its Open Graph preview (title, "
"image, description)."
msgstr ""
"Wenn ein Beitrag eine URL enthält, rufe seine Open-Graph-Vorschau (Titel, "
"Bild, Beschreibung) ab und zeige sie an."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1008
msgid "Enable emoji picker"
msgstr "Emoji-Auswahl aktivieren"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1010
msgid "Show the emoji picker button in the post composer and comment editor."
msgstr ""
"Zeige die Emoji-Auswahl-Schaltfläche im Beitragskomponist und im "
"Kommentareditor an."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1017
msgid "Show new-posts indicator"
msgstr "Indikator für neue Beiträge anzeigen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1019
msgid ""
"Show a \"new posts\" pill on the activity feed when fresh posts arrive. "
"While the feed tab is open it checks for new posts about once a minute "
"(paused when the tab is hidden); turn this off to stop those background "
"checks entirely. Developers can tune the cadence with the "
"buddynext_feed_new_count_interval filter."
msgstr ""
"Zeige ein \"neue Beiträge\"-Plakette im Aktivitätsfeed an, wenn neue "
"Beiträge ankommen. Während der Feed-Tab offen ist, prüft er ungefähr einmal "
"pro Minute auf neue Beiträge (pausiert wenn der Tab verborgen ist); schalte "
"dies aus, um diese Hintergrundprüfungen ganz einzustellen. Entwickler können "
"das Intervall mit dem buddynext_feed_new_count_interval-Filter anpassen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1026
msgid "Post edit window (minutes)"
msgstr "Bearbeitungszeitraum für Beiträge (Minuten)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1029
msgid ""
"How many minutes after posting a member can edit their post. Set to 0 for no "
"limit."
msgstr ""
"Wie viele Minuten nach dem Posten ein Mitglied seinen Beitrag noch "
"bearbeiten kann. Setze auf 0 für unbegrenzt."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1049
msgid "Ask for a note when connecting"
msgstr "Nach Notiz bei Verbindungsanfragen fragen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1052
msgid ""
"Off (default): one click sends the connection request, like Facebook. On: "
"the member is asked to add a short note with their request, like LinkedIn - "
"and that note is delivered to the recipient as a direct-message request so "
"they can decide whether to engage before accepting."
msgstr ""
"Aus (Standard): Ein Klick sendet die Verbindungsanfrage wie bei Facebook. "
"An: Das Mitglied wird gebeten, eine kurze Notiz mit seiner Anfrage "
"hinzuzufügen, wie bei LinkedIn - und diese Notiz wird dem Empfänger als "
"Direktnachrichtenanfrage zugestellt, damit dieser entscheiden kann, ob er "
"sich einbinden möchte, bevor er akzeptiert."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1076
msgid ""
"Choose which reactions members can use on posts and comments. At least one "
"is always kept."
msgstr ""
"Wähle, welche Reaktionen Mitglieder bei Beiträgen und Kommentaren verwenden "
"können. Mindestens eine wird immer beibehalten."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1079
msgid ""
"Reactions are turned off under Platform → Features. Enable the Reactions "
"feature there to choose which emoji members can use."
msgstr ""
"Reaktionen sind unter Plattform → Funktionen deaktiviert. Aktiviere die "
"Reaktionen-Funktion dort, um zu wählen, welche Emojis Mitglieder verwenden "
"können."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1113
msgid "Creation & limits"
msgstr "Erstellung & Grenzen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1119
msgid "Who can create spaces"
msgstr "Wer kann Spaces erstellen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1122 includes/Spaces/CoreSpaceFields.php:203
msgid "Any member"
msgstr "Jedes Mitglied"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1125
msgid ""
"Restricting to admins prevents members from creating unmoderated spaces."
msgstr ""
"Die Beschränkung auf Admins verhindert, dass Mitglieder unmoderierte Spaces "
"erstellen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1132
msgid "Max spaces per member"
msgstr "Max. Spaces pro Mitglied"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1134
msgid ""
"Maximum number of spaces a single member can create. Set to 0 for no limit. "
"Admins are exempt."
msgstr ""
"Maximale Anzahl von Spaces, die ein einzelnes Mitglied erstellen kann. Setze "
"auf 0 für keine Begrenzung. Admins sind ausgenommen."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1141
msgid "Allow sub-spaces"
msgstr "Sub-Spaces erlauben"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1144
msgid ""
"Let space owners create spaces nested inside their own. Turn off to keep "
"every space top-level."
msgstr ""
"Lasse Space-Besitzer Spaces in ihrem eigenen verschachteln. Schalte aus, um "
"alle Spaces auf der obersten Ebene zu halten."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1151
msgid "Max sub-spaces per space"
msgstr "Max. Sub-Spaces pro Space"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1153
msgid ""
"Maximum number of sub-spaces a space owner can create inside their space. "
"Set to 0 for no limit."
msgstr ""
"Maximale Anzahl von Sub-Spaces, die ein Space-Besitzer in seinem Space "
"erstellen kann. Setze auf 0 für keine Begrenzung."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1160
msgid "New-space defaults"
msgstr "Standards für neue Spaces"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1166
msgid "Default visibility for new spaces"
msgstr "Standardsichtbarkeit für neue Spaces"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1175
msgid ""
"The visibility a space starts with when created. Owners can still change it "
"per space."
msgstr ""
"Die Sichtbarkeit, mit der ein Space beginnt, wenn er erstellt wird. Besitzer "
"können sie für jeden Space noch ändern."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1182
msgid "Default category for new spaces"
msgstr "Standardkategorie für neue Spaces"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1195
msgid ""
"New spaces without a chosen category are filed here. Manage the list under "
"Spaces → Directory → Categories."
msgstr ""
"Neue Spaces ohne gewählte Kategorie werden hier abgelegt. Verwalte die Liste "
"unter Spaces → Verzeichnis → Kategorien."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1212
msgid "Post Approval (Pre-Moderation)"
msgstr "Beitragsgenehmigung (Vormoderation)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1218
msgid "Hold posts for approval"
msgstr "Beiträge zur Genehmigung halten"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1221
msgid "Off — every member posts instantly (recommended)"
msgstr "Aus — jedes Mitglied postet sofort (empfohlen)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1222
msgid "New members only — hold their first posts until approved"
msgstr "Nur neue Mitglieder — halte ihre ersten Beiträge bis zur Genehmigung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1223
msgid "Posts with links — hold anything containing a URL"
msgstr "Beiträge mit Links — halte alles, das eine URL enthält"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1224
msgid "Everything — hold every post until a moderator approves"
msgstr "Alles — halte jeden Beitrag bis ein Moderator genehmigt"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1226
msgid ""
"Held posts wait in the Moderation > Pending queue and never appear in feeds "
"until approved. Off by default — a community grows by welcoming people, so "
"only turn this up if you start seeing spam. Admins and moderators are never "
"held."
msgstr ""
"Gehaltene Beiträge warten in der Moderation > Warteschlange Ausstehend und "
"erscheinen niemals in Feeds, bis sie genehmigt werden. Standardmäßig aus — "
"eine Gemeinschaft wächst durch die Willkommenskultur, daher schalte dies nur "
"ein, wenn du anfängst, Spam zu sehen. Admins und Moderatoren werden niemals "
"gehalten."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1233
msgid "New-member posts to review"
msgstr "Beiträge neuer Mitglieder zum Überprüfen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1236
msgid ""
"When holding \"New members only\", review this many of a member's first "
"posts before they post freely. Used only by the New members mode."
msgstr ""
"Wenn \"Nur neue Mitglieder\" gehalten wird, überprüfe so viele erste "
"Beiträge eines Mitglieds, bevor es frei postet. Wird nur im Modus \"Nur neue "
"Mitglieder\" verwendet."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1243
msgid "Auto-Moderation Thresholds"
msgstr "Schwellenwerte für automatische Moderation"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1249
msgid "Auto-hide after N reports"
msgstr "Automatisches Verbergen nach N Meldungen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1252
msgid ""
"Content is hidden automatically once it reaches this number of reports. "
"Reviewable in the moderation queue."
msgstr ""
"Inhalte werden automatisch verborgen, sobald sie diese Anzahl von Meldungen "
"erreichen. Sie können in der Moderationswarteschlange überprüft werden."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1259
msgid "Queue alert threshold"
msgstr "Schwellenwert für Warteschlangen-Warnung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1262
msgid ""
"Send a daily email to admins when the moderation queue exceeds this many "
"unreviewed items. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Sende eine tägliche E-Mail an Admins, wenn die Moderationswarteschlange "
"diese Anzahl nicht überprüfter Elemente übersteigt. Setze auf 0, um zu "
"deaktivieren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1269
msgid "Strike System"
msgstr "Verwarnungssystem"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1275
msgid "Strikes before warning"
msgstr "Verwarnungen bis Warnung"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1278
msgid "A warning email is sent to the member after this many active strikes."
msgstr ""
"Eine Verwarnungs-E-Mail wird an das Mitglied nach dieser Anzahl aktiver "
"Verwarnungen gesendet."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1285
msgid "Strikes before suspension"
msgstr "Verwarnungen bis Suspension"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1288
msgid "The member is automatically suspended after this many active strikes."
msgstr ""
"Das Mitglied wird nach dieser Anzahl aktiver Verwarnungen automatisch "
"suspendiert."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1295
msgid "Strikes before permanent ban"
msgstr "Verwarnungen bis permanenter Bann"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1298
msgid ""
"The member is permanently banned after this many lifetime strikes. Set to 0 "
"to disable automatic permanent bans."
msgstr ""
"Das Mitglied wird nach dieser Anzahl von Verwarnungen auf Lebenszeit "
"dauerhaft verbannt. Setze auf 0, um automatische permanente Banns zu "
"deaktivieren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1305
msgid "Content Safeguards"
msgstr "Inhaltssicherungsmaßnahmen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1311 includes/Spaces/CoreSpaceFields.php:139
#: templates/parts/space-settings-panel-moderation.php:78
msgid "Banned words"
msgstr "Verbotene Wörter"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1312
msgid ""
"One word or phrase per line. Posts containing any of these are rejected. "
"Case-insensitive substring match."
msgstr ""
"Ein Wort oder eine Phrase pro Zeile. Beiträge, die eines dieser Wörter "
"enthalten, werden abgelehnt. Groß-/Kleinschreibung-insensitiver Substring-"
"Abgleich."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1319
msgid "Banned hashtags"
msgstr "Verbotene Hashtags"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1320
msgid ""
"One hashtag per line (without the # sign). Posts using these tags are "
"rejected."
msgstr ""
"Ein Hashtag pro Zeile (ohne das #-Zeichen). Beiträge mit diesen Tags werden "
"abgelehnt."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1327
msgid "Blocked link domains"
msgstr "Blockierte Link-Domänen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1328
msgid ""
"One domain per line (e.g. spam.example.com). Posts linking to these domains "
"are rejected."
msgstr ""
"Eine Domäne pro Zeile (z. B. spam.example.com). Beiträge, die auf diese "
"Domänen verlinken, werden abgelehnt."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1335
msgid "Blocked IP addresses"
msgstr "Blockierte IP-Adressen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1337
msgid ""
"One IP address per line (IPv4 or IPv6). These addresses cannot sign in, "
"register, post, or comment - including on accounts they already hold. Your "
"own address cannot be added. Invalid entries are dropped on save."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1344
msgid "Post rate limit (per minute)"
msgstr "Post-Ratenlimit (pro Minute)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1347
msgid ""
"Maximum number of posts a member can create per minute. Set to 0 to disable "
"rate limiting."
msgstr ""
"Maximale Anzahl von Beiträgen, die ein Mitglied pro Minute erstellen kann. "
"Setze auf 0, um die Ratenbegrenzung zu deaktivieren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1354
msgid "Comment rate limit (per minute)"
msgstr "Kommentar-Ratenlimit (pro Minute)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1357
msgid ""
"Maximum number of comments a member can post per minute. Set to 0 to disable "
"rate limiting."
msgstr ""
"Maximale Anzahl von Kommentaren, die ein Mitglied pro Minute posten kann. "
"Setze auf 0, um die Ratenbegrenzung zu deaktivieren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1364
msgid "Duplicate post window (minutes)"
msgstr "Fenster für doppelte Beiträge (Minuten)"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1367
msgid ""
"Hold a post for review when the member has already posted identical content "
"within this many minutes. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Halte einen Beitrag zur Überprüfung, wenn das Mitglied bereits identische "
"Inhalte in dieser Anzahl von Minuten gepostet hat. Setze auf 0, um zu "
"deaktivieren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1374
msgid "New member review threshold"
msgstr "Überprüfungsschwellenwert für neue Mitglieder"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1377
msgid ""
"Posts by members with fewer than this many published posts are held for "
"review. Set to 0 to disable."
msgstr ""
"Beiträge von Mitgliedern mit weniger als dieser Anzahl veröffentlichter "
"Beiträge werden zur Überprüfung gehalten. Setze auf 0, um zu deaktivieren."

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1394
msgid "Default Notification Preferences"
msgstr "Standard-Benachrichtigungseinstellungen"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1400
#: includes/Notifications/NotificationMessageService.php:566
#: includes/Notifications/NotificationPrefCatalogue.php:58
#: includes/Onboarding/SetupWizard.php:807
msgid "New follower"
msgstr "Neuer Follower"

#: includes/Admin/Settings.php:1402
msgid "Notify users by default when someone follows them."
msgstr "Benachrichtige Benutzer standardmäßig, wenn jemand ihnen folgt."

